@@ -3,3 +3,24 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module (`src/index.ts`)
+
+`createRentalService()` returns an in-memory service: `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+Tests: `npm test` (`test/`).
+
+School rules, which apply to everything the module does:
+
+1. Money is an integer number of euro cents.
+2. Times are in UTC, written as ISO-8601 strings.
+3. A booking covers whole days only: a period starts and ends at midnight UTC, and ends at the start of
+   the day after its last day (periods are half-open, so back-to-back bookings do not overlap).
+4. The same item cannot be booked twice for overlapping periods.
+5. Cancellation policy: a booking cancelled less than 24 hours before its start gets no refund;
+   otherwise the full amount is refunded.
+
+Not implemented yet: cancellations (rule 5 is for when they are added; bookings keep their `total`
+in cents so the refund can be computed from it).
+
+Choices made: dates are accepted only as `YYYY-MM-DDT00:00[:00[.000]]Z` (or `+00:00`) and returned exactly
+as given; ids and equipment are unique; `dailyPrice` must be a non-negative integer.
